{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Yakuza</strong> is an anime-style cosy adventure tactics set in a gritty, modern Tokyo-inspired city teeming with gang turf wars, shady back alleys, and rooftop secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Zuka</strong>, the young and chaotic new boss of a fallen otter clan. With your family scattered and your turf overtaken by the unhinged <strong>Cobra Corp.</strong>, it's time to reclaim your name, rebuild your empire, and teach the city who really owns the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crate-smuggling cosy street tactic missions to rooftop onsen upgrades, every mission challenges your crew\u2019s skills, loyalty, and cuteness. Switch between  playable otters with unique personalities, build your hideout, and make choices that ripple across the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game.<br>This is family.<br>This is business.<br>This is <strong>Otter Yakuza</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The river always remembers.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE COSY ADVENTURE TACTICS GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every barrel, pole, and vending machine counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.poster.avif?t=1759685204\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.webm?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.mp4?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE-OTTER CREW SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between otters with unique play styles to help Otter Boss Zuka avoid trouble, as he is causing chaos in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.poster.avif?t=1759685204\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.webm?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.mp4?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHILL IN THE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your hideout with an onsen, a money laundry, a tattoo parlour, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.poster.avif?t=1759685204\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.webm?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.mp4?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIVAL GANGS AND ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the chaotic, punk Gekkos and other cute but dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.poster.avif?t=1759685204\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.webm?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.mp4?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RICH STORYTELLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with honour, betrayal, slapstick chaos, and Otter Yakuza energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLER FRIENDLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for short, punchy sessions or deep story dives.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711790?t=1759685204","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/7c7530714c3e9354cb9e1ac7b43e7c4c96ebde49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759685204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/474ea266dabf991625755d2f09e608e97f12ea63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759685204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/474ea266dabf991625755d2f09e608e97f12ea63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759685204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Yakuza</strong> is an anime-style cosy adventure tactics set in a gritty, modern Tokyo-inspired city teeming with gang turf wars, shady back alleys, and rooftop secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Zuka</strong>, the young and chaotic new boss of a fallen otter clan. With your family scattered and your turf overtaken by the unhinged <strong>Cobra Corp.</strong>, it's time to reclaim your name, rebuild your empire, and teach the city who really owns the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crate-smuggling cosy street tactic missions to rooftop onsen upgrades, every mission challenges your crew\u2019s skills, loyalty, and cuteness. Switch between  playable otters with unique personalities, build your hideout, and make choices that ripple across the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game.<br>This is family.<br>This is business.<br>This is <strong>Otter Yakuza</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The river always remembers.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE COSY ADVENTURE TACTICS GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every barrel, pole, and vending machine counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.poster.avif?t=1759685204\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.webm?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.mp4?t=1759685204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE-OTTER CREW SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between otters with unique play styles to help Otter Boss Zuka avoid trouble, as he is causing chaos in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=